Culture Nuggets Discord Bot

A simple Discord bot that shares one daily tech trivia about computer science. Built with Python and discord.py, it picks a random nugget from a JSON file and posts it to your Discord server.

⚙️ Setup

pip install discord.py

Add your Discord bot token in data.json

Run: python commands.py

📁 Files

commands.py – main bot logic

data.json – trivia database
